  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It looks ordinary, like a grey rock with an uneven surface that is neither squarish nor spherical. Thrown on a road, no one would notice it from appearance. It is the essence of a rock, a natural Gu, living and thinking even though it looks inanimate.",
        "chapters": [
          116
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is rank one.",
        "chapters": [
          116
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s aperture it sinks to the bottom of the primeval sea beside the White Jade Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          116
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_white_jade_gu"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It grants stealth and conceals the body, making the user invisible to ordinary sight.",
        "chapters": [
          116
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Clothes, wrist guards, leg wrappings, and bamboo shoes stay visible, so a clothed Gu Master still shows as a walking uniform unless stripped bare.",
        "chapters": [
          121
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It also cannot hide blood traces.",
        "chapters": [
          116
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After Fang Yuan obtains it, he still has no Gu that can hide his middle stage aura, and his cultivation level is exposed a day later.",
        "chapters": [
          116
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The monkey king uses the Gu for sneak attacks in the rock forest. Fang Yuan guesses the rank one stealth rock Gu from the stealth that fails against blood, then confirms the name when the worm floats from the corpse toward a new king. He grabs it, lets the Spring Autumn Cicada leak aura until the worm stops struggling, and refines it with red primeval essence.",
        "chapters": [
          116
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He judges it has little practical use while he still wears clothes, and he begins collecting ingredients to fuse it while advancing toward rank two upper stage.",
        "chapters": [
          116
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-early-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
